#13551
ailiah~
Ailiah~
Ailiah awaits the arrival of another customer.~
She has matted nondescript brown hair and empty plain eyes.  Her clothing looks
as if she hasn't purchased anything new in the past fifty years as the colors
are all faded and the hems have been repaired on more than one occasion.  As
you stand here, you hope her wares are much better than her clothes.  You feel
a sense of comfort as you think about the shop's location in the headquarters.
~
