#13551
Aviaran Airborne Army Acceptance Act~
Aviaran Airborne Army Acceptance Act~
An important Aviaran document hovers above the ground.~
With this document, you are about to accept a great and awesome responsibility.
You shall henceforth hate all cats who walk about.  You shall believe in your
heart that the only good cat is a dead cat and in that manner, attempt to make
all cats good cats.  You must AGREE to these terms to be permitted to join the
vaunted Aviaran Airborne Army.
~
